      "widgets_values": [
        "Upload the ORIGINAL static textured Trellis GLB and its matching RGB photo.\n\nThe face is detected / registered anew. Only face texture is projected; vertices, geometry and original assets are preserved. No Anima, regeneration, fitting or added geometry.\n\nYaw (degrees) adjusts the source registration view when needed. Queue the graph, inspect comparison and corrected viewer. SaveGLB writes 3d/FaceTextureOnly_*.glb."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Upload the ORIGINAL static textured Trellis GLB and its matching RGB photo.\n\nThe face is detected / registered anew. Only face texture is projected; vertices, geometry and original assets are preserved. No Anima, regeneration, fitting or added geometry.\n\nYaw (degrees) adjusts the source registration view when needed. Queue the graph, inspect comparison and corrected viewer. SaveGLB writes 3d/FaceTextureOnly_*.glb."
